      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "SejuaniW",
        "name": "凛冬之怒",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "瑟庄妮两次挥舞她的链枷，造成伤害、减速敌人并施加霜冻层数。",
        "bodyHtml": "瑟庄妮挥击她的链枷，造成<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(5/15/25/35/45 + ([[si:scaleap]]30% 法术强度) + ([[si:scalehealth]]4% 生命值))物理伤害</span>并<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">击退</span>小兵和野怪。然后她会再次挥击，造成<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(5/25/45/65/85 + ([[si:scaleap]]60% 法术强度) + ([[si:scalehealth]]8% 生命值))物理伤害</span>并暂时<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">减速</span>目标。<br /><br />两段挥击都会施加<span>永冻</span>效果。",
